### ============================================================
### Live Quiz API Tests — VS Code REST Client
### ============================================================
### HOW TO USE:
###   1. Install extension: "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
###   2. Click "Send Request" above any request below
###   3. Response appears in a split panel on the right
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### ── STEP 1: Create a Quiz ───────────────────────────────────
# @name createQuiz
POST {{baseUrl}}/quiz
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "General Knowledge Quiz"
}

### ── STEP 2: Add Question 1 ──────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/question/quiz/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionText": "What is the capital of France?",
  "optionA": "Berlin",
  "optionB": "Madrid",
  "optionC": "Paris",
  "optionD": "Rome",
  "correctAnswer": "C"
}

### ── STEP 3: Add Question 2 ──────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/question/quiz/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionText": "Which planet is known as the Red Planet?",
  "optionA": "Earth",
  "optionB": "Mars",
  "optionC": "Jupiter",
  "optionD": "Venus",
  "correctAnswer": "B"
}

### ── STEP 4: Add Question 3 ──────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/question/quiz/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionText": "What is 7 x 8?",
  "optionA": "54",
  "optionB": "56",
  "optionC": "62",
  "optionD": "48",
  "correctAnswer": "B"
}

### ── STEP 5: Player 1 Joins ──────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/player/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "quizId": 1
}

### ── STEP 6: Player 2 Joins ──────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/player/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob",
  "quizId": 1
}

### ── STEP 7: Start the Quiz ──────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/quiz/1/start

### ── STEP 8: Get a Random Question ──────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/question/quiz/1/random

### ── STEP 9: Alice Submits Correct Answer ───────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/player/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": 1,
  "questionId": 1,
  "selectedOption": "C"
}

### ── STEP 10: Bob Submits Wrong Answer ──────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/player/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": 2,
  "questionId": 1,
  "selectedOption": "A"
}

### ── STEP 11: Check Alice's Score ───────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/player/1/score

### ── STEP 12: See All Players in Quiz ───────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/player/quiz/1

### ── STEP 13: View Leaderboard ──────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/player/quiz/1/leaderboard

### ── STEP 14: End the Quiz ──────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/quiz/1/end

### ── STEP 15: Final Leaderboard ─────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/player/quiz/1/leaderboard

### ── EXTRA: Get Quiz Details ────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/quiz/1

### ── EXTRA: Get All Quizzes ─────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/quiz

### ── EXTRA: Get All Questions in Quiz ───────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/question/quiz/1
